{title: Spirit of God, Descend upon My Heart}
{artist: George Croly & Frederick Atkinson}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 69}

Verse 1
[Eb]Spirit of God, de[Bb]scend upon my [Cm]heart:
[Ab]wean it from earth, through [Eb]all its pulses [Bb]move;
[Eb]stoop to my weakness, [Bb]mighty as thou [Cm]art,
and [Ab]make me [Eb]love thee [Bb]as I [Eb]ought to love.
